@HostAddress = http://localhost:5169
@BranchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@RoleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# ==============================================================================
# 1. PERMISSION GROUPS & PERMISSIONS CATALOG
# ==============================================================================

### 1.1 List All Permission Groups (With Constituent Permissions)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/permission-groups
Accept: application/json

###

# ==============================================================================
# 2. DYNAMIC ROLES LIFECYCLE
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Create a Dynamic System Role (e.g. Senior Cashier)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "roleName": "senior-cashier",
  "description": "Senior cashier with POS register and daily closing privileges."
}

###

### 2.2 List Dynamic Roles (Paginated with Search & Filters)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles?page=1&pageSize=10&search=cashier&isActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.3 Get Role Details By ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles/{{RoleId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2.4 Synchronize Assigned Permission Groups (Full Sync - ADR-004 & ADR-005)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles/{{RoleId}}/permission-groups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "permissionGroupIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
  ]
}

###

### 2.5 Edge Case: Revoke All Permissions (Empty Array - Vacuous Truth Semantics)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles/{{RoleId}}/permission-groups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "permissionGroupIds": []
}

###

### 2.6 Edge Case: Validation Failure (Empty Role Name - RFC 7807 ProblemDetails)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "roleName": "",
  "description": ""
}

###

# ==============================================================================
# 3. PHYSICAL RETAIL BRANCHES LIFECYCLE
# ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Create a New Supermarket Retail Branch
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "BR-01",
  "name": "Main Hypermarket - Sanaa",
  "street": "Hadda Street, Block 14",
  "city": "Sanaa",
  "region": "Capital Secretariat",
  "postalCode": "12345",
  "phone": "+9671234567",
  "taxNumber": "TAX-987654321",
  "email": "hadda.branch@supermarket.com",
  "currency": "YER"
}

###

### 3.2 List Branches (Paginated with Search & Active Status Filters)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches?page=1&pageSize=10&search=Sanaa&isActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.3 Get Branch Complete Operational Details By ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches/{{BranchId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.4 Update Branch Operational Details & Weekly Operating Hours
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches/{{BranchId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Main Hypermarket - Sanaa (Renovated)",
  "street": "Hadda Street, Tower Building 2",
  "city": "Sanaa",
  "region": "Capital Secretariat",
  "postalCode": "12345",
  "phone": "+9671234567",
  "taxNumber": "TAX-987654321",
  "email": "hadda.renovated@supermarket.com",
  "operatingHours": [
    {
      "dayOfWeek": 0,
      "openingTime": "08:00:00",
      "closingTime": "23:00:00",
      "isOvernight": false
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": 4,
      "openingTime": "08:00:00",
      "closingTime": "02:00:00",
      "isOvernight": true
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3.5 Temporarily Deactivate Branch Operations (e.g. Maintenance)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches/{{BranchId}}/deactivate
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.6 Restore Branch Operational Status (Reactivate)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches/{{BranchId}}/activate
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.7 Soft-Delete Branch (Enterprise Preservation of Historical Ledger)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches/{{BranchId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.8 Edge Case: Validation Failure (Invalid Phone Format & Empty Code)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/branches
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "name": "Invalid Branch",
  "street": "Short",
  "city": "City",
  "region": "Region",
  "postalCode": null,
  "phone": "invalid-phone",
  "taxNumber": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "currency": "YER"
}

###
